ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Wang gives a profound opinion at a literary symposium. Everyone admires his point of view. At this time, Xiao Li suddenly stands up, shows a cunning smile, and says, \"Oh, Xiao Wang, you are so talented, why don't you write a sequel to 'Dream of the Red Chamber'? I definitely buy!\" The whole audience laughs. Xiao Wang also smiles and says, \"Okay, when I finish writing, I give it to you to read first.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Li say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Li really thinks Xiao Wang has the talent to write a sequel to 'Dream of the Red Chamber'.\nB. Xiao Li says this because he wants to tease Xiao Wang through a joke and express his admiration for Xiao Wang.\nC. Xiao Li thinks Xiao Wang's viewpoint is too profound and wants to make him speak simpler through this way.\nD. Xiao Li says this because he wants to show their close relationship to everyone through a joke.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266812674176312,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1b1d6006945d28002be","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367921220,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"60e41919e4bf4c6ba76a9b922e5d6234"}